msgctxt "quest/035/LucKzj017_03580:TEXT_LUCKZJ017_03580_ONDOPEOPLEB03580_000_031:1"
msgid "Oh? This is what it means to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>chuckle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>? Are you sure? It does not seem to quite capture the sense of sssincere but measured delight I was ssstriving to convey..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ヒトの子、若者への教示、感謝する。<br>体も浮かぬ状況で、意思疎通ができる、至極器用。<br>また、難しい表現があったら、教え願う。
#. de: Ah, <if $gn4>Flossenlose<else>Flossenloser</if>, du bist zurück. Fsssh<nbsp>... Und, konntest du unseren jüngeren Ondo ein paar neue Gesten beibringen? Sehr gut. Sie werden dich bestimmt bald wieder bitten, ihnen etwas Neues beizubringen.
#. fr: Fssshah, te revoilà, humain<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Tu as appris quelques gessstes aux jeunes d'iccci<nbsp>? Je t'en sssuis très re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant. Tiens, voilà pour toi.
#. speaker: DEUSHSAATH
msgctxt "quest/035/LucKzj017_03580:TEXT_LUCKZJ017_03580_DEUSHSAATH_000_035:1"
msgid "The koal seem to be in high ssspirits─or perhaps they have grown that skilled at expresssing themselves with the chuckle already? That is all the more reason I have to thank you for our instruction, then."
msgstr ""
